{"video":"BoaTOggzuUs","lines":[{"t":[0,5],"en":"Pecan Sandy, just made them."},{"t":[5,8],"en":"Yeah, alright."},{"t":[8,11],"en":"What are these, raisins?"},{"t":[11,13],"en":"Uh, sure, why not?"},{"t":[20,22],"en":"Listen, Eddie, uh..."},{"t":[22,25],"en":"I've been thinking about our current living situation"},{"t":[25,28],"en":"and, uh, why are you smiling?"},{"t":[28,29],"en":"I got a little surprise."},{"t":[29,32],"en":"Look, that's a new fishy."},{"t":[32,35],"en":"I named him, uh, Chandler, you know, after..."},{"t":[35,37],"en":"after you."},{"t":[45,49],"en":"Well, that's not even a real fish."},{"t":[49,53],"en":"No, that's a goldfish cracker."},{"t":[53,56],"en":"So what's your point, man?"},{"t":[58,64],"en":"Okay, goodnight, you big freak of nature."},{"t":[64,65],"en":"You big freak of nature."}]}
